OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny fleeting
OL,6,Fevening showers will clear away to
OL,7,Fleave a dry night with clear spells.
OL,8,FWinds easing down for most but staying
OL,9,Fblustery in coastal regions.
OL,10,FTemperatures falling away, especially
OL,11,Finland and turning rather cool in the
OL,12,Fcountryside.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FA fine day on Sunday with
OL,15,Fplenty of sunny spells and staying
OL,16,Fdry. Skies may cloud over at times but
OL,17,Fit will feel pleasantly warm in the
OL,18,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
