OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FCloudier on Monday with mist and
OL,7,Fdrizzle over the hills but turning
OL,8,Fhumid and feeling warm in any
OL,9,Fsunshine. Sunny intervals developing
OL,10,Fon Tuesday. Cooler, windier and wetter
OL,11,Fon Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
